[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9780.07, "timestamp": "02:43:00", "text": "ええ、私のにも付いていますよ。 私のも使っています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9798.87, "timestamp": "02:43:18", "text": "私の法的通知に懐疑的な人が何人かいたんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9801.83, "timestamp": "02:43:21", "text": "彼らは、「ああ、法律の一部や、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9805.51, "timestamp": "02:43:25", "text": "言及されている条項の一部は時代遅れだ」などと言っていました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9809.19, "timestamp": "02:43:29", "text": "。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9812.71, "timestamp": "02:43:32", "text": "彼らに「これはチップに似ている」とさえ言いました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9814.87, "timestamp": "02:43:34", "text": "チップみたいにしてはいけないよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9817.67, "timestamp": "02:43:37", "text": "性別を決めなきゃいけないよ。だって、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9821.27, "timestamp": "02:43:41", "text": "私は知らなかったから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9824.309, "timestamp": "02:43:44", "text": "それについて尋ねたら、彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9827.75, "timestamp": "02:43:47", "text": "私設GPDのチップを見せてくれたんだ。 はい、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9830.63, "timestamp": "02:43:50", "text": "JPTのビジネス版があります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9834.23, "timestamp": "02:43:54", "text": "だから彼はそれを作ったんだ。彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9836.63, "timestamp": "02:43:56", "text": "自分の仕事のすべて、彼がこれまでやってきたことすべてを"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9839.22, "timestamp": "02:43:59", "author": "@TheDivineGokuBlack", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/x2pzeEVaf1zyUBkZCrzTAzUJCua_ZlOHqOBCVhiADyCWmaW54l65hftnOmbOFY2vCGVSXGk5Ng=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Well detectives might use Akinator to find the criminal so ig Lawyers are also allowed to use Chatgpt"}]